Third-party data

The files src/data/165-blocklist.txt and src/data/165-meta.json are derived
from open data published by the National Police Agency, Ministry of the
Interior (Taiwan), 165 Anti-Fraud Consultation Hotline, and are used under the
Open Government Data License, version 1.0 (政府資料開放授權條款第 1 版):
https://data.gov.tw/license

Those files are not covered by the MIT License above.
